+```bash
+CHILD_ID=$(gh api /repos/{owner}/{repo}/issues/{child_number} --jq '.id')
+gh api /repos/{owner}/{repo}/issues/{parent_number}/sub_issue -X DELETE -F sub_issue_id="$CHILD_ID"
+```
